  "content": {
    "title": "When does 'Beauty in Black' Season 2, Part 2 come out? What to know.",
    "text": "March 18, 2026, 3:04 p.m. ETKimmie's dominance, Mallory's clapbacks and epic action are ahead in Tyler Perry's \"Beauty in Black\" Season 2, Part 2.The viral drama series is returning to Netflix this week, and according to actress Crystle Stewart, who plays Mallory, fans can expect a \"wild ride.\"\"You're going to see more of Mallory and Kimmie coming together head to head, which I think people are waiting for,\" Stewart told USA TODAY in September.Here's what we know about \"Beauty in Black\" Season 2, Part 2.When does 'Beauty in Black' Season 2, Part 2 premiere on Netflix?All eight episodes of \"Beauty in Black\" Season 2, Part 2 will stream on Netflix Thursday, March 19 at 3 a.m. ET.Kimmie is on top this seasonIn an exclusive clip of Season 2, Part 2 obtained by USA TODAY, Kimmie (Taylor Polidore Williams) and Jules (Charles Malik Whitfield) challenge one another in an intense verbal exchange.In the next installment, Kimmie is not afraid to confront her former pimp, Jules, as she begins her new role as the head honcho at her husband Horace's mega beauty brand.\"I think she's enjoying this role reversal with Jules at this moment because of the years of abuse that she's endured from him,\" actress Taylor Polidore Williams told USA TODAY.Watch 'Beauty in Black' Season 2, Part 2 Trailer'Beauty in Black' Main CastTaylor Polidore Williams as KimmieCrystle Stewart as MalloryAmber Reign Smith as RainXavier Smalls as AngelRicco Ross as HoraceJulian Horton as RoySteven G. Norfleet as CharlesDebbi Morgan as OliviaRichard Lawson as NormanCharles Malik Whitfield as JulesTerrell Carter as VarneyTaylor Ardrey is a news reporter for USA TODAY. You can reach her at tardrey@usatodayco.com.",
